flowchart TD
    A["1. Problem Definition<br/>Understand the problem and define objectives"] --> B["2. Data Collection<br/>Gather relevant data from different sources"]
    B --> C["3. Data Storage and Management<br/>Organise and maintain collected data"]
    C --> D["4. Data Cleaning<br/>Correct missing, duplicated and inconsistent data"]
    D --> E["5. Data Transformation and Preparation<br/>Convert data into an appropriate analytical format"]
    E --> F["6. Exploratory Data Analysis (EDA)<br/>Explore distributions, relationships and patterns"]
    F --> G["7. Data Analysis and Modelling<br/>Apply appropriate analytical and statistical methods"]
    G --> H["8. Interpretation and Validation<br/>Verify results and understand their meaning"]
    H --> I["9. Data Visualization and Communication<br/>Present findings through charts, reports and dashboards"]
    I --> J["10. Decision-Making and Monitoring<br/>Take action, measure outcomes and improve the process"]
    J --> A
